#: build-src/install/index.md:23
msgid   "If you don't have maven installed you can run this command:"
msgstr  "Si vous avez choisi de ne pas installer maven vous devez lancer "
        "cette commande:"

#: build-src/install/index.md:27
msgid   "And use `./mvnw` instead of `mvn`."
msgstr  "Et utilisez `./mvnw` a la place de `mvn`."

#: build-src/install/index.md:29
msgid   "Then you can run the compilation command for numahop:"
msgstr  "Ensuite lancez la commande de compilation pour NumaHOP:"

#: build-src/install/index.md:32
msgid   "# Or using the just file\n"
msgstr  ""

#: build-src/install/index.md:37
msgid   "If you have errors during compilation run `mvn -Dfast=true package`. "
        "It disables all exections non needed to build numahop such as tests, "
        "code analysis and formating. Once the compilation succeds a file `./"
        "target/numahop-yy.mm.jar` should be present in the directory. Move "
        "this file at this path: `/opt/pgcn/numahop.jar`. The name of the war "
        "is not important but its location is. Once that is done we can run "
        "NumaHOP. It should launch and crash rather quickly."
msgstr  "Si vous rencontrez des erreurs pendant la compilation lancez `mvn "
        "-Dfast=true package`. Cela desactive toute les execution non "
        "necessaires pour la compilation comme les tests, l'analyse du code "
        "ou la vérification du formatage du code. Une fois que la compilation "
        "est faite un fichier `numahop-yy.mm.jar` devrait être présent dans "
        "le dossier `target`. Pour l'installation deplacez ce fichier vers `/"
        "opt/pgcn/numahop.jar`. C'est le chemin d'installation par default de "
        "NumaHOP."

